OL,3,GNEWSADrug driver head teacher made
OL,4,A'huge mistake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school head teacher made a
OL,7,F"huge mistake" when she was caught drug
OL,8,Fdriving, a panel found.
OL,10,FAmanda Rogers, 61, led South Stoke
OL,11,FPrimary School, Oxfordshire, when she
OL,12,Fwas arrested for driving a Nissan Micra
OL,13,Fon the A33 in Reading with cannabis in
OL,14,Fher system in November 2024.
OL,16,FShe was banned from driving for 12
OL,17,Fmonths, fined #269 and told to pay a
OL,18,Fvictim surcharge of #108 at Reading
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court in January 2025.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
